 promising schoolboy at Summer Fields School (where one of the four 'leagues' is named after him), and he was awarded a King's scholarship to attend Eton College."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d03", "start": 265, "end": 321, "text": "In 1906 he won the chemistry and physics prizes at Eton."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d03", "start": 322, "end": 430, "text": "In 1906, Moseley entered Trinity College of the University of Oxford, where he earned his bachelor's degree."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d03", "start": 431, "end": 601, "text": "Immediately after graduation from Oxford in 1910, Moseley became a demonstrator in physics at the University of Manchester under the supervision of Sir Ernest Rutherford."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d03", "start": 602, "end": 624, "text": "During Moseley's first"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d04", "start": 0, "end": 593, "text": "NCERT Books for Class 8 NCERT Books for Class 9 NCERT Books for Class 10 NCERT Books for Class 11 NCERT Books for Class 12 NCERT Exemplar NCERT Exemplar Class 8 NCERT Exemplar Class 9 NCERT Exemplar Class 10 NCERT Exemplar Class 11 NCERT Exemplar Class 12 RD Sharma RD Sharma Class 6 Solutions RD Sharma Class 7 Solutions RD Sharma Class 8 Solutions RD Sharma Class 9 Solutions RD Sharma Class 10 Solutions RD Sharma Class 11 Solutions RD Sharma Class 12 Solutions PHYSICS Mechanics Optics Thermodynamics Electromagnetism Famous Physicists Unit Conversion Kirchhoff 's Laws Faraday 's Law Laws"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d05", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "name in some such way ” ( Nature 115 , 543-546 , 1925 ) ."}, "D6S2": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0413-23a29397367b:d05", "start": 58, "end": 448, "text": "The following short statement by Ernest Rutherf